# Welcome to my first hypersite

This is a simple, static hypersite served entirely from a Hypergraph.
No server, no files on disk for a visitor to fetch - this page itself
lives inside the graph as content on a page:index entity.

## About

HyperBBS renders HyperMD directly from P2P data. If you can see this
page, you connected to the owner's Hypergraph, replicated it locally,
and now you could disconnect and still have a full copy.

::bigtext[HYPERBBS]{font=tiny}

## Features shown here

- Plain markdown text
- A heading hierarchy
- This list itself

---

*Thanks for visiting.*
